      {
        "y": 371.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 485.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rewrite the underlined words using words and expressions from the opposite page."
      },
      {
        "y": 388,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 535,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Recently, the country’s economy has suffered a decline in industry concerned with making things."
      },
      {
        "y": 400,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 462.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 The university has long been in a very important position in agricultural science."
      },
      {
        "y": 412,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 420.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The river delta tends to suffer catastrophic flooding on a regular basis."
      },
      {
        "y": 424,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 481.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 One can often see local shepherds looking after large flocks of sheep on the hillsides."
      },
      {
        "y": 436,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 535,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 In the late 18th century, migrants made their home in the uncultivated lands towards the north of"
      },
      {
        "y": 448,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 178.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the country."
      },
      {
        "y": 460,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 376.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 In the extremely dry southern provinces, plant life is sparse."
      },
      {
        "y": 472,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 522.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 In the cold northern regions, the landscape consists mostly of permanently frozen ground with"
      },
      {
        "y": 484,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 164,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "no trees."
      },
      {
        "y": 496,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 534.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The tribes that have always existed naturally in the eastern jungles are now facing threats to their"
      },
      {
        "y": 508,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 172.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "way of life."
      },
      {
        "y": 520,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 520.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 The farmlands are dotted with woods that lose their leaves in winter, while the large forests of"
      },
      {
        "y": 532,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 440.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "trees that are always in leaf provide the country with much-needed timber."
      },
      {
        "y": 544,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 523.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 The flat grasslands of the northern USA experienced a severe long period with no rain last year."
      },
      {
        "y": 567.5,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "28.5"
      },
      {
        "y": 571.7,
        "x0": 127.7,
        "x1": 208.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Over to you"
